cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "MDF analysis of ethanol production pathways in thermophilic anaerobes"
abstract: >-
  Max-min Driving Force (MDF) analysis of alternative glucose-to-ethanol pathways in
  Clostridium thermocellum and Thermoanaerobacterium saccharolyticum, evaluated at high
  ethanol titer, including routes that differ in how electrons are transferred from
  reduced ferredoxin to NAD(P) and in the cofactor specificity of the aldehyde and
  alcohol dehydrogenase steps.
authors:
